## Import

Import using the receiver UID (`metadata.name`), or `<org id>:<receiver uid>` for an organization other than the
provider's default:

```shell
terraform import grafana_apps_notifications_receiver_v1beta1.name "<receiver uid>"
```

Credentials are not returned by the API, so they must be set in the configuration after importing.
